{"id":"gamefreak-lineblog-7743977","kind":"blog","type":"Game Freak 博客","card":"blog","title":"【日记】2016旧金山灯塔之旅","display_title":null,"dek":null,"excerpt":"为迎接媒体采访，增田顺一在旧金山观光，探访灯塔、博物馆，品尝当地牡蛎并为接下来的工作补充能量。","date":"2016-10-03","publication":"増田順一 公式ブログ · LightHouse","source":{"title":"増田順一 公式ブログ · LightHouse","url":"https://lineblog.me/masudajunichi/archives/7743977.html","archive_url":"https://web.archive.org/web/20161006035407id_/https://lineblog.me/masudajunichi/archives/7743977.html","type":"official_blog_wayback"},"issue":null,"interviewee":[],"people":[{"name":"增田顺一","slug":"masuda-junichi"}],"mentions":[],"works":[],"tags":["Game Freak","增田顺一","LINE BLOG","日記"],"categories":["官方博客","Game Freak","数字存档"],"topics":[],"primary_work":null,"length":629,"era":null,"url":"https://docs.pokeamice.com/gamefreak-director/lineblog-7743977/","body_kind":"markdown","segment_count":null,"pages":0,"proof":null,"cover":"https://docs.pokeamice.com/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/7743977/001-ab7fc63cc4.webp","cover_kind":"own","size":[1136,852],"archive_type":"gamefreak_masuda_lineblog","summary":"为迎接媒体采访，增田顺一在旧金山观光，探访灯塔、博物馆，品尝当地牡蛎并为接下来的工作补充能量。","interviewer":null,"translator":null,"original_lang":null,"translation_status":"openai-machine-translated","body":{"kind":"markdown","markdown_zh":"<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">旧金山是星期日</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">为了迎接明天开始的</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">媒体采访</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">去观光对付时差（笑）</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">这次住的酒店</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">也在任天堂公司附近的</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">Palo Alto地区</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">从那里一路向北</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">来到了这里！</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/7743977/001-ab7fc63cc4.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/7743977/001-ab7fc63cc4.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">站在高处，脸都僵了（笑）</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">没想到</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">这里就是</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/7743977/002-46b776a4a1.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/7743977/002-46b776a4a1.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n灯塔！\nPoint Reyes LightHouse!\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/7743977/003-44aa6cbbe6.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/7743977/003-44aa6cbbe6.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n在300多级台阶的尽头！\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n为了看这座灯塔\n从酒店花了3个多小时\n终于抵达了！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/7743977/004-4f45b46771.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/7743977/004-4f45b46771.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"840\"></a></figure>\n\n一路上还有牛，也有绝美的景色，可看的东西多得不得了！\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n灯塔本身也建在相当高的地方\n真佩服他们居然能在这种地方造灯塔\n一直感叹不已！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/7743977/005-e2833e8f37.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/7743977/005-e2833e8f37.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"621\" height=\"840\"></a></figure>\n\n在这么强的风和这么高的地方\n                    <br>\n\n\n造东西……\n肯定非常辛苦\n真的很厉害\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n感动完了\n肚子也饿了\n于是去吃午餐（笑）\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n想吃点这片土地上的东西\n于是点了牡蛎！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/7743977/006-37ea75003b.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/7743977/006-37ea75003b.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n三种都好吃到不得了！\n\n<br>\n\n\n                有位\n            \n吃午餐的时候\n一位老爷爷\n告诉我有个有趣的东西……\n\n<br>\n\n\n去看看！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/7743977/007-7e54e2bcf3.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/7743977/007-7e54e2bcf3.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n沉船？好像是观光名胜……虽然我也不太明白（笑）\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n                稀里糊涂地\n来到了旧金山\n市中心（笑）\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n金门大桥\n果然还是那么稳！\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/7743977/008-006d9942e1.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/7743977/008-006d9942e1.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n不管来多少次，我都最喜欢这座桥！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n附近的\n华特迪士尼博物馆\n我也去逛了逛！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/7743977/009-e60cec77f9.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/7743977/009-e60cec77f9.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/7743977/010-9f595baade.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/7743977/010-9f595baade.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/7743977/011-98da2e6a1d.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/7743977/011-98da2e6a1d.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n当然了解了米老鼠诞生的故事\n也充分感受到\n华特迪士尼先生\n超级制作人的一面！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n我原以为\n哥哥才是实业家\n没想到他本人也是\n非常了不起的实业家\n以前完全不知道\n\n<br>\n\n\n学到了很多东西！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n然后……\n今晚的晚餐\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n为了迎接明天开始的\n媒体采访\n吃了我最喜欢、能为自己补充能量的食物！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/7743977/012-855d4b1522.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/7743977/012-855d4b1522.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\"Hello!\"\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n好了\n从明天开始的两天\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n因为已经储备好能量了\n我会全力以赴！！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n下回再见！\n<br></div>","markdown_ja":"<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">サンフランシスコは日曜日</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">明日からの</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">メディアインタビューに向けて</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">時差ボケ対策のため観光（笑）</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">今回もホテルは</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">任天堂さんに近い</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">Palo Altoという地域</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">そこから北上して</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">ここまで来ました！</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/7743977/001-ab7fc63cc4.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/7743977/001-ab7fc63cc4.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">高所で顔がこわばってる（笑）</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">なんと</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">ここは</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/7743977/002-46b776a4a1.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/7743977/002-46b776a4a1.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n灯台！\nPoint Reyes LightHouse!\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/7743977/003-44aa6cbbe6.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/7743977/003-44aa6cbbe6.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n300段以上ある階段の先にありました！\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nこの灯台を見るために\nホテルから3時間以上かけて\nようやく到着！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/7743977/004-4f45b46771.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/7743977/004-4f45b46771.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"840\"></a></figure>\n\n途中にも牛がいたり素晴らしい景色があったりと見どころ満載！\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n灯台自体もかなり高い場所にあって\nこんなところによく灯台作ったなぁと\n関心しきり！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/7743977/005-e2833e8f37.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/7743977/005-e2833e8f37.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"621\" height=\"840\"></a></figure>\n\nこの強風と高さでの\n                    <br>\n\n\nものづくりは・・・\nとても大変だったはず\nほんと すごい\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n感動したら\nお腹減ったので\nランチを食べに（笑）\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nこの土地のものが食べたくて\n牡蠣を注文！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/7743977/006-37ea75003b.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/7743977/006-37ea75003b.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n3種類とも激ウマだった！\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n                なんか\n            \nランチ食べてたら\nおじいさんが\n面白いものあるよって教えてくれて・・\n\n<br>\n\n\n行ってみた！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/7743977/007-7e54e2bcf3.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/7743977/007-7e54e2bcf3.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n難破船？観光名所らしい・・・よくわかんないけど（笑）\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n                よくわからないまま\nサンフランシスコの\n中心部に移動（笑）\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n安定の\nゴールデンゲートブリッジ！\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/7743977/008-006d9942e1.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/7743977/008-006d9942e1.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n何度来ても大好きな橋です！\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n近くにある\nウォルトディズニー博物館にも\n行ってみたよ！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/7743977/009-e60cec77f9.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/7743977/009-e60cec77f9.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/7743977/010-9f595baade.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/7743977/010-9f595baade.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/7743977/011-98da2e6a1d.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/7743977/011-98da2e6a1d.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\nミッキーマウスの誕生話はもちろん\nウォルトディズニーさんの\nスーパープロデュースっぷりが\nとっても分かりました！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nお兄さんが実業家だと\n思っていたのですが\nご本人も凄い実業家だったのですね\n知らなかったです\n\n<br>\n\n\nいろいろと勉強になりました！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nそして・・・\n今宵のディナー\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n明日からの\nメディアインタビューに向けて\nパワーになる大好きな食べ物を\nいただきました！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/7743977/012-855d4b1522.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/7743977/012-855d4b1522.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\"Hello!\"\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nさあ\n明日からの2日間\n\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nエネルギー蓄えたので\n全開で頑張ってきます！！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nチャオ！\n\n<br></div>"}}